{"server":"en","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-08_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-08","title":"Resolve","storyCode":"1-8","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"73860a20a5cea197182cb1f4bffd969ef046a85e5898fa3ed60dec37a0b3d565","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十一关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, take the Doctor with you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"...Go, now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No! I won't leave you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Surely, you can feel it as well! She... If you don't leave, the entire rescue team will die here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"That Talulah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"She is a living monster! Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll be fine, as long as we stand together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"What about the Doctor, then? Can you ensure the Doctor's safety?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"... Hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Team E4, we will stay behind and hold the line!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We must ensure that Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}, and the Medic teams escape safely!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"No, my squad will handle this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace! Be rational, now's not the time to argue over this!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"I am rational."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Surely you can see it as well - everything around her is melting!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not going to leave you all here to fight alone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island... won't abandon you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, time is of the essence! You have to escape!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"...You should trust me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't bear to see Rhodes Island sacrifice anyone!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Think about our goal! Think about what we came here for!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't the time to talk about that still!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"--? The heat... is concentrating in her hands?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Is she... distorting the space around her?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"No, that's... the superheated air around her!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out! She's getting ready to use her Arts..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... You can't! Nearl!! Come back, now!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That's not her... You'll be killed if you--"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"... Silence."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Uaaaaagh...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh... Gahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*... Stay back! Don't worry about me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just... a little warm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you saying... don't worry?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't have a single intact piece of armor on you, and you're telling me not to worry? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"You mustn't fight her anymore!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I already said... Stay back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl! You stubborn son of a...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"... Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Get down!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*... What is it this time!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"... Invisible flames just swept over our head."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Fall back. This entire block is melting..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't sacrifice yourself in vain!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Just what monstrosity am I fighting against?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to interrupt her casting somehow..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Snipers, take aim at the enemy!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Resistance will usher hope into this land."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"But resistance... will not change your fate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Fire!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Chernobog has already attained liberation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Our work here is done, and your group has proven to be quite interesting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"What..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"However, that is all you are worth."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"You have chosen poorly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island, you should have stood firmly with the Infected."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"What's... going on?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Why is the entire plaza... getting scorched?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"What... happened... just now...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I can't breathe... it burns..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Rocks, bolts, arrows..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"They're all gone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"In a heartbeat... every object around her has been reduced to nothingness..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"You have the resilience of liberators."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"... Not even ashes remain..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya. You know what must be done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Someone... has to stop her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"...But I grow tired of this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"This is the price you must pay for slaughtering your fellow Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"I shall grant you an ending that I am quite fond of."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"...Disappear."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn it!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Run... hurry!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"That amount of heat, at such a scale... No, no!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Protect Amiya and the Doctor! Quick!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We won't make it...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll block her!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"AAAAAGH!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh???"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"A-Amiya?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You will not hurt them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I will never... allow you to do that!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"-----Oh?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I must... protect everyone...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya is holding back the enemy's Arts... all by herself...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's no good... That power is too tremendous!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Even Amiya won't be able to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"She won't be able to hold out for long!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry... Don't worry about me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can handle this...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I want to... I must... protect you all!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Dark matter... is sealing the enemy's Arts within the plaza..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh... Argh... Ughh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"H-her barrier is catching on fire!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, stop!! Your ring will--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't care... even if..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, I'm sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if this brings disaster, even if I...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want to lose... the person dearest to me... ever again..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Very good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aghh... Aaaaaahhh...!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn it... We're going to lose her...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Destroying that she-dragon's Arts!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"... 'O Light of Kazimierz, the Radiant Knight offers her body to thee...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor! Just go! We'll help Amiya, but you have to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"--!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaaaaaghhh!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That's enough, Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"--?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"You've done well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Let us share your burden."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Dobermann, take her with you. I'll see you soon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"...Ace..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace... No... Ace...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Promise me... that you'll..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry, Dr. {@nickname}. You might not remember me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"But I remember you, and I know what kind of person you are."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"... There will come a day when you and Amiya will face this cruel land together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"That is why... you must cherish her, Doctor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Godspeed."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Ace","Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["Talulah"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]}]}
